        "source_sentence": "Sulfone-containing random copolycarbonates were also synthesized by reacting the respective mixtures of bisphenol S : bisphenol A, with feed ratios 80 : 20, 60 : 40, 50 : 50, 40 : 60, 20 : 80, and 0 : 100, with TCF in the DCE-aqueous sodium hydroxide two-phase system with BTEAC as catalyst [eq. (4)]."
